{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/month_grid.dart:offset-8394", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/month_grid.dart", "location": "offset-8394", "text": "'One cell per day. Darker is further up YOUR own range — the '\n'10th to 90th percentile of every day you have stored — and '\n'an outlined cell is a day with no value, not a low one. '\n'More strain is not better strain and longer sleep is not '\n'healthier sleep; this says where a day sat, not how it went.'", "sha256": "c74e9d104430a580904f39dddc0f6a419231a578339e252326c322cc7b5dcf81", "kind": "dart", "start": 8394, "end": 8788, "line": 203}
